OL,3,GNEWSAEstate faces hay shortage due to
OL,4,Adrought conditions
OL,5,
OL,6,FA National Trust estate says it is
OL,7,Ffacing a hay shortage as grass growth
OL,8,Fhas stalled in drought conditions,
OL,9,Fresulting in livestock being given
OL,10,Fwinter feed.
OL,12,FMeadows which normally produce 150
OL,13,Ftonnes of hay at Wimpole Estate in
OL,14,FCambridgeshire have this year yielded
OL,15,Fnothing, the conservation charity said.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
