OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAEstate faces hay shortage due to
OL,4,Adrought conditions
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is the third time in five years that
OL,7,Fthe estate has faced severe drought
OL,8,Fimpacts, with new programmes being
OL,9,Fimplemented including tree planting,
OL,10,Fincreasing rainwater storage and
OL,11,Fconservation grazing to reduce wildfire
OL,12,Frisk and support habitat restoration.
OL,14,FWimpole's farm and countryside manager
OL,15,FDave Hassall said: "We're already using
OL,16,Fwinter feed because summer growth
OL,17,Fsimply hasn't happened."
